  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.30 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Midwifery Council",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.30 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Midwifery Council. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.30, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the midwifery council under RSA 326-D:\n\nTable 1002.30 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for Professions Regulated by the Midwifery Council\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nMidwife certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $121\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
